      en: ["An NGO based in Bansalan, Davao del Sur.", "Develops sustainable agricultural technologies.", "Famous for the Sloping Agricultural Land Technology (SALT).", "SALT is a method to prevent hillside soil erosion.", "Promotes the planting of nitrogen-fixing trees.", "Its methods have been adopted internationally.", "Empowers rural communities through practical farming."],
