      en: ["One of the largest safari parks in the Philippines, located in Carmen, Cebu.", "Spans over 170 hectares of land.", "Home to more than 1,000 animals from over 100 species.", "Features one of the longest ziplines in the country.", "The African Savannah is a major highlight.", "Boasts a large collection of orchids in Michel's Garden.", "Combines wildlife conservation, education, and adventure."],
