      en: ["A national park and shrine located in Quezon City.", "Dedicated to the second Philippine President, Manuel L. Quezon.", "The central mausoleum stands 66 meters tall.", "The three pylons represent Luzon, Visayas, and Mindanao.", "A popular spot for exercise, picnics, and community events.", "Houses the QCX (Quezon City Experience) Museum.", "Serves as a vital green lung for Metro Manila."],
